    },
    {
      "paper_id": "doi-10-1145-290941-290953",
      "decision": "ADMIT",
      "reason": "The abstract directly studies online event detection in a chronological stream, including whether incoming material belongs to an observed event or signals a new event. That decision structure is a strong transfer analogue for CONTINUE versus NEW and provides foundational evidence for incremental assignment rather than retrospective clustering alone. Identifier is UNCHECKED, but the capability is clear from the abstract.",
